        dct:description "Module docstring cites Haupaix et al. (2018) DOI `10.1126/science.aar4777`, but the v1 script does not load `avian_plumage_somite_stripes_reference.json` or verify SHA-256 digests of `datasets/avian_plumage_somite_stripes/` at runtime." ;
